      "title": "Added ProfiNet v2.5 CIM records. Syslog SD bugfix.",
      "message": "Added ProfiNet v2.5 CIM records. Syslog SD bugfix.\n\nAdded ProfiNet CIM related records from specification v2.5\nAdded dissection of the Auditable Events using syslog dissector.\n - added Fence on column info to prevent syslog dissector overwriting it.\nFixed bug in dissection of the Structured Data part of the syslog dissector.\n\nAssisted-by: GitHub Copilot\n",
